# Opening Edge / ply-chess TTS
# None of these are required. With zero env vars the app uses free
# Microsoft Edge neural TTS, then the browser Web Speech API.

# Optional paid/better provider. Server-only — never prefix with NEXT_PUBLIC_.
# Create a key at https://elevenlabs.io → Developers → API keys.
# Vercel: Project → Settings → Environment Variables → Production + Preview.
# ELEVENLABS_API_KEY=

# Optional. Default is stock voice "George" (JBFqnCBsd6RMkjVDRZzb) —
# warm mature male narrator / chess professor.
# ELEVENLABS_VOICE_ID=JBFqnCBsd6RMkjVDRZzb

# Optional. Default free professor voice: en-GB-RyanNeural
# (British male neural, slightly slowed + lowered pitch).
# Other deep male options: en-US-GuyNeural, en-GB-ThomasNeural
# EDGE_TTS_VOICE=en-GB-RyanNeural
